{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>38歲「籃球女神」方泳琳與40歲前甲一球星陳張敏驚爆嚴重婚姻衝突，雙方將家事搬上社交平台引發激烈罵戰。男方率先 …</p><p></p>\n<p>38歲「籃球女神」方泳琳與40歲前甲一球星陳張敏驚爆嚴重婚姻衝突，雙方將家事搬上社交平台引發激烈罵戰。男方率先以限時動態發文暗諷女方人設造假，女方隨即火力全開狂轟對方長期虛偽兼罔顧幼女健康。</p>\n<h2>上月尾ViuTV夫妻檔晒恩愛 轉頭即反面開火</h2>\n<p>方泳琳與陳張敏上月尾才以甜蜜夫妻姿態齊齊現身ViuTV綜藝節目《邊個瞓梳化？》參與錄影，女方當時更在網上發布合照展露燦爛笑容。事隔不足半個月，陳張敏於10月31日突然在社交平台發布一張抱住初生女兒舊照，並以黑底白字寫下「一個將自己人設set到女神咁既女人，癲起上嚟真係唔係一般人承受得起，我唔知究竟係咪揀錯路」。這番充滿火藥味言論瞬間辣㷫女方，令原本看似幸福美滿關係瞬間瓦解，雙方正式展開連日隔空罵戰。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454280622272456_12054652546af68cd69a06d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"62dd0bf4bb093d74dd582610404ccf25.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454280622272456_12054652546af68cd69a06d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「籃球女神」方泳琳（Jessie）與丈夫陳張敏於 2023 年 12 月 27 日結婚，至今（2026 年 11 月）結婚接近 3 年（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945428087873857_9702570546af68cd93841f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_871252722_18645725962044979_5661567742595865440_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945428087873857_9702570546af68cd93841f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>上月尾ViuTV夫妻檔晒恩愛（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>兩公婆隔空駁火火藥味濃 方泳琳怒轟虛偽「食煙湊女」</h2>\n<p>面對突如其來公開指責，方泳琳火速截圖反擊並狠批男方「承諾過嘅一樣都冇做到」，更直斥對方一直營造慈父形象全屬假象。她毫不留情踢爆陳張敏私下甚少陪伴年僅15個月大女兒，連上載網上所謂父女溫馨照亦只是翻箱倒櫃找出來舊相。當中觸發女方底線是男方長期有不良嗜好，方泳琳怒罵「仲話love個女forever，又係得個講字囉，食煙喎，帶啲3手煙俾個女叫love？」，同時堅定表明「我就一定知道自己係揀錯嫁喇！」。</p>\n<h2>方泳琳出動AI拆解陳張敏心理 直斥男方逃避責任</h2>\n<p>這場風波最令外界震驚一環，是方泳琳將男方發文直接交由人工智能進行深度心理評估，並公開詢問「一個咩人先會講呢段說話，佢講呢段嘢嘅動機係乜嘢？」。系統分析報告毫不客氣指出男方正處於「防禦心極強、試圖轉移焦點，且感到尊嚴受損」狀態，並帶有「自尊心極高且好面子」、「成熟度不足，習慣逃避責任」等特質。隨後女方轉戰Threads發布長文大吐苦水，控訴自己每日包辦家庭開支與接送幼女，經濟完全獨立卻不獲體諒，相反男方僅陪伴數分鐘便輕易獲得好爸爸稱讚。</p>\n<h2>貼文交AI深度心理分析 網民笑爆：公審界新高度</h2>\n<p>兩大球壇猛將互相揭發私隱極端手法引起全城熱烈討論，不少網民對於動用人工智能分析另一半性格做法感到不可思議。部分網民留言表示「用AI分析老公真係史無前例」、「公審界去到全新高度」，更有人諷刺男方「話人哋人設自己咪又係扮好爸爸」。期間亦有支持男方帶有吸煙惡習湊女言論出現，方泳琳即時公開標記對方帳號反擊「你有支持者 」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281115682519_2557729146af68cdb7c4d9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_762655254_18614658526044979_5774277876001575794_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281115682519_2557729146af68cdb7c4d9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281386296855_6016091966af68cde84536.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319088269559272139.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281386296855_6016091966af68cde84536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281553686347_18845503486af68ce024dff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319088269559272138.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281553686347_18845503486af68ce024dff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281747180084_2765020556af68ce21ecfb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319088269559272136.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281747180084_2765020556af68ce21ecfb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/11_8433116986846b0f4535e8-1024x1279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 Jessie的老公陳張敏（Ryan）曾是南華球員，也是前男子組合4anda成員之一，現時效力於甲二球隊愉園，擔任隊長。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/11_8433116986846b0f4535e8-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Jessie的老公陳張敏（Ryan）曾是南華球員，也是前男子組合4anda成員之一。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10_17415872636846b0f22b980-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 二人結婚1年半，早前宣布懷孕喜訊。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10_17415872636846b0f22b980-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>二人結婚1年半就宣布懷孕喜訊。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/03_16133528756846b0e4c72af-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 （圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳 ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/03_16133528756846b0e4c72af-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳 ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/08_4471861036846b0ee5035e-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 （圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/08_4471861036846b0ee5035e-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%b3%e7%90%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方泳琳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%bc%b5%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳張敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9b%a2%e5%a9%9a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離婚</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3541607\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:36:29.255592+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1706,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:07:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:30:02.234374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:30:02.234374+00:00","content_hash":"3163668be88e4b1c614ed6b751636e02b01f07db827977281953f2374221b4c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}